    "RemoteLoaderCfg root PC566..569: CLIENT_DOWNLOAD_PATH.resPath + pc/res/assets/runtime/voice/buttonSound/%s.mp3; getUISoundUrl0.182 formats it. These resources are downloaded separately, not embedded APK audio.",
    "GameButtonBar0.9: BtnSure for OK/TAO/JIU, GameHold for cancel/ignore, TurnOver for discard.",
    "GameMenuNew0.14: SystemMenuClick; GameSelfSeatUi0.120: CardSortAndSelectAll for sort/select-all."
  ],
